      "content": "thanks. that works. \n\ncan we add a bit more detail about the purpose of the maintenance? we want to frame it as a proactive measure to prevent the kind of weird, localized disruptions that can happen if a system is neglected—like when you get those small, inexplicable jumps in temperature or odd, rattling noises in the ducts that seem to happen out of nowhere. we want them to know we're doing this to stop those little mechanical nuisances before they get any worse.",
